      "text": "e. (1) Subject to approval by the Corporation Counsel, direct the contracting agency concerned to cancel, terminate, suspend, or cause to be cancelled, terminated, or suspended, any contract, or any portion or portions thereof, for failure of the contractor or subcontractor to comply with the nondiscrimination provisions of the contract. Such contracts may be cancelled, terminated or suspended absolutely, or continuance thereof or the award of future contracts may be conditioned upon a program for future compliance approved by the City Administrator.",
